<title>TAIWAN: GOLF-FIRST ROUND SCORES IN SUPER TOUR.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FIRST ROUND SCORES IN SUPER TOUR.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round scores in the $350,000</p>
<p>Johnnie Walker Super Tour on Tuesday</p>
<p>67 Lin Keng-chi (Taiwan), Park Nam-sin (South Korea), Ernie Els</p>
<p>(South Africa)</p>
<p>68 Colin Montgomerie (Scotland), Ian Woosnam (Wales)</p>
<p>71 Felix Casas (Philippines)</p>
<p>72 Vijay Singh (Fiji)</p>
<p>75 Chawalit Plaphol (Thailand)</p>
<p>(Eight-man field only; second, third and fourth rounds to be</p>
<p>played in Seoul, Manila and Bangkok over the next six days).</p>
</text>
